      value: Protag
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: -4178046375966092550, guid: cc20ee66cb2684d34a25721a77f81c2a, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: linksToOtherDialogue
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.sentences.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: I see. Then you must have a lineage of magic users.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: I suppose it matters not.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Santi, I received a vision of our future\u2026 your present. I saw
        ruined houses and a war that caused unprecedented destruction\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: To put it bluntly, I want to change that future. Will you help me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
